      "Unit§Reaver Titan": {
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 2200
          }
        },
        "text": "WARNING: this unit was not in 10e and needs importing.\n\n**Striding Colossus**\nEach time you target this model with a Stratagem, you must spend three times that Stratagem’s stated CP cost to do so.\n\n**God-machine**\nThis model is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Unit§Warbringer Nemesis Titan": {
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 2600
          }
        },
        "text": "WARNING: this unit was not in 10e and needs importing.\n\n**Striding Colossus**\nEach time you target this model with a Stratagem, you must spend three times that Stratagem’s stated CP cost to do so.\n\n**Titanic Fire Support**\nIn your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly **IMPERIUM** model makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, on a Critical Wound, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Unit§Warhound Titan": {
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 1100
          }
        },
        "text": "WARNING: this unit was not in 10e and needs importing.\n\n**Striding Colossus**\nEach time you target this model with a Stratagem, you must spend twice that Stratagem’s stated CP cost to do so.\n\n**Flank Speed**\nEach time this model Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 8\" to the Move characteristic of this model."
      },
      "Unit§Warlord Titan": {
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 3500
          }
        },
        "text": "WARNING: this unit was not in 10e and needs importing.\n\n**Striding Colossus**\nEach time you target this model with a Stratagem, you must spend four times that Stratagem’s stated CP cost to do so.\n\n**Wrath of the Omnissiah**\nIn your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. That unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      }
